 jawas who quickly  steal his armor from him while he's on  ground this immediately ties into the  mandalorian chapter 9 wherein din jaren  comes across cop bam he's the marshal of  most pelgo who buys boba's armor and  rocket pack from the jawas to protect  the small town from gangsters as well as  the behemoth crate dragon if being  mugged by jawas isn't enough boba is  also set upon by tuscan raiders who tie  him up and take him back to their camp  luckily he isn't tortured the way  anakin's mom is during attack of the  clones but they do tie him up with a  captured rodian as a massive keeps watch  obviously boba isn't the type to stay  put when he's captured and quickly makes  us escape into the desert although he's  pursued by the tuscans they're extremely  vicious as boba finds out when he's  forced to fight one of them  interestingly his opponent uses a gappy  stick similar to the one boba wields in  the mandalorian he's definitely going to  become an honorary sand person although  they're not on friendly terms just yet  and he loses the fight  the flashback sequence is over once  fenix shand wakes boba up out of his  back to nap and it's time to get to the  bulk of the story there's a power vacuum  left on tatooine following jabba the  hutt's death and return of the jedi and  clearly boba feels he's the one to fill  it but it's going to take more than the  bounty hunter saying he's the new crime  lord for him to establish rule even when  the respective crime factions start  bringing tributes to vet the mayor of  mos espa doesn't even show up instead  sending his twilight major domo to ask  for a tribute from boba that's not a  good sign but still the bounty hunter  turned crime lord is determined to turn  over a new leaf intending to rule with  respect instead of embracing jabba's  iron-fisted approach so this therian  major domo manages to leave with his  life it's a bizarre change for the  bounty hunter who has long been fueled  by revenge and rage although clearly  there's more to this plot point at least  some of the planet's authority figures  bowed to boba  would you like your gomorian's hose down  and fed while we are sequestered  notably a twilight known as madame garza  fills his helmet with credits she runs a  bar called sanctuary and it looks a lot  cleaner than the most eisley cantina  this juxtaposition between boba and  jabba's rule critically sets the stakes  for the rest of the series while some  denizens of the desert underworld like  garso will likely embrace boba's new  regime others will summarily reject it  years of toiling under the murderous  huts has likely led many factions on  tatooine to view boba's more reasonable  style as a sign of weakness a weakness  they are likely to exploit  sure boba might be one of the most  feared bounty hunters in the entire  galaxy but tuscan raiders simply don't  care they'll turn anyone into a slave  pets in the unnamed rhodian are forced  to wander through the desert with a  tuscan youngling and they come across a  band of looters raiding a random  moisture farm they don't intervene  simply watching from afar expect boba to  encounter the gang later in the series  from there the tuscan young lean forces  boba and the rodian to dig up black  melons from under the sand unfortunately  the rodian uncovers a giant six-limbed  behemoth which can only be described as  a lizard centaur thanks to the way it  runs with its torso facing upwards  luckily boba uses his chains to strangle  a giant beast to death in the same way  princess leia kills jabba the hutt in  return of the jedi since he saves the  tuscan youngling the episode ends with  the sand people accepting fett as the  leader hands him a melon to drink from  on their return  his alliance with the tuscans is  probably how the bounty hunter survives  on tatooine for so long without his  armor in his signature spaceship but  we'll probably learn more whenever boba  takes it back to nap in future episodes  by the 